# Copy to .env and adjust for your setup; see README.md's "Connecting to
# the backend" and docs/adrs/0002-same-origin-api-proxy.md.

# Where the Vite dev server proxies /api to. Defaults (in vite.config.ts)
# to http://host.docker.internal:8000, reaching the sibling template-fastapi
# repo's own devcontainer via its forwarded port 8000. Override if you run
# the backend directly on the host instead (http://localhost:8000) or on a
# different port.
# VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:8000

# OIDC settings (src/auth/config.ts) -- defaults match the backend's own
# devcontainer Keycloak realm/client, so these are only needed to point at
# a different realm.
# VITE_OIDC_AUTHORITY=http://localhost:8080/realms/template-fastapi
# VITE_OIDC_CLIENT_ID=api
